      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T14:14:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we just define a version (0?) where the features are unknown? Seems odd that you might have a strongbox keystore but not the feature itself.\n\nDitto for feature above.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3205,
        "startChar": 0,
